.TH SHB-ENV 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-env \- Manage environment and live secret updates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb env [edit]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides safe live editing of environment secrets. During active agent sessions, 'shb env edit' opens the real backup in $EDITOR and automatically refreshes the in-tree synthetic file for the active session without exposing secrets to the sandboxed agent.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb env edit\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
